# C# Conventions

- Namespace root: `BPD.*` matching system folders (`BPD.Run`, `BPD.Level`, …).
- ScriptableObject assets: prefer `SO_` / `DA_` prefixes in asset names by type.
- Prefer interfaces for cross-system APIs: `ISplitMinigame`, `ICardEffect`, skill hooks.
- Comments in English; describe logic only — no tutorial fluff.
- Prefer Edit Mode tests for merge rules, stat math, and card effect application.
- Keep MonoBehaviours thin: orchestrate; put rules in plain C# / SO data.
- No unused public fields; expose tunables on ScriptableObjects / config.
